      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-305211",
      ":question/problem": "A clothing manufacturer is buying $g$ jackets and $h$ hats for a shipment. The manufacturer needs to purchase more than $22$ items in total, but wants to spend less than $$400$. Each jacket costs $$18$ and each hat costs $$6$.\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.The system of inequalities that models this situation is the following:\n$18g + 6h < 22$ {{field-1}} {{field-2}}"
